{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐2026競選決賽》今晚（8月30日）舉行，賽前當然有大家個關注的紅地氈環節，頭先帶大家睇完頭輪出場的前港姐，郭珮文身材力壓全場，成為最大焦點。而家到第二輪，有人可以同郭珮文鬥一鬥，立即帶大家睇睇！</p><figure><img alt=\"合照。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803601690333184941726.jpeg/LLFfWr1wIev6NTK_seq0PLpUPwOtsEJ5f0kDnklJA54\"/><figcaption>合照。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803610926714880369154.jpeg/AmlUULIdv2F76D4zG2yGJycAZPmFDyB8WJqOnW6ajp0\"/><figcaption>何沛珈。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803608544219136320541.jpeg/MIaW0jG2j6uh7VA3iO8ZYdc3SlzcLamyIPYjnBb2I5w\"/><figcaption>何沛珈。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何詠多。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803606329495552201349.jpeg/W8n3g6NPGp8LMYgp_BF_ggeroi0OzFNsUAJermYCXq4\"/><figcaption>何詠多。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何詠多。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803604207046656180497.jpeg/0eHNsmdUt3f3E91ly7Nh8-Z6Ln0-mpEsotAHBpTQBwY\"/><figcaption>何詠多。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大家幫手整下條裙。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170803601937797120941682.jpeg/Le_txfEv93icrHOkm2sAG2dGYAiHpDdtUHl-HWZ5fh0\"/><figcaption>大家幫手整下條裙。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T11:38:30.689454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}